            "value": "按攀爬當天篩選；舊記錄預設使用匯入日期，可以在回看頁修改。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filter by the day you climbed. Older climbs use the import date; edit it from the replay."
          }
